    {
     "who": "brandt",
     "text": "Walter Brandt, station manager. The Commission, at this hour! We run a clean shop, I promise you."
    },
    {
     "who": "brandt",
     "text": "Anything you need, Rosa will help. Just keep the noise down near Studio A, would you?"
